/www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RUvUB2Ecf</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RUvUB2Ecf</guid><pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>哈利波特系列中最黑暗的一部！一代传奇陨落，最终之战打响！</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115813021391586&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1SYiMBbEGe" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f081ce5bf7246b84e4541076e68ef08fc4c12c88.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;《哈利波特与混血王子》这一集中，食死徒开始肆无忌惮横行于麻瓜和魔法两个世界中，霍格沃茨内忧外患，危机重重。邓不利多带着哈利辗转找到隐居多年的霍拉斯·斯拉格霍恩，请他出山接替斯内普担任魔药学的老师。霍拉斯曾经教授过无数优秀的学生，而汤姆·里德尔——伏地魔——正是他最出色的一名弟子</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SYiMBbEGe</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SYiMBbEGe</guid><pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>一部“粗制滥造”的喜剧悬疑片，评分竟然超过了《唐探》这样的同类标杆</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115802669848386&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1eyvWBVEvk" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9a0af4a4ef7cdddc27797289b8063d6648e889ac.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;《平原上的夏洛克》超英翻盖新房 ，占义、树河前来帮忙，没想到树河却因意外车祸入院，司机肇事逃逸，超英和占义化身“平原侦探”，踏上了一段令人啼笑皆非的荒诞追凶之旅。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eyvWBVEvk</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eyvWBVEvk</guid><pubDate>Tue, 30 Dec 2025 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>原始人的生活比现代更精彩？你不知道的史前世界还有这些发明</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115801646502059&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1ycvpB9EL5" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/52692c2ec6c678fb1020f35180286b071624b9ba.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;《疯狂原始人》原始人咕噜一家六口在老爸Grug的庇护下生活。每天抢夺鸵鸟蛋为食，躲避野兽的追击，每晚听老爸叙述同一个故事，在山洞里过着一成不变的生活。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ycvpB9EL5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ycvpB9EL5</guid><pubDate>Mon, 29 Dec 2025 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item></channel></rss>